<title>BELGIUM: TABLE - Belgian net debt 9,889.8 bln bfr at June 30.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Belgian net debt 9,889.8 bln bfr at June 30.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury released the following data on the state's debt (in billion francs):</p>
<p>    STATE DEBT	     end-June  change in mth  change in 1997</p>
<p>Long-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 6,939.4   - 14.2	    - 59.4</p>
<p>    foreign currencies     697.2   +  0.1	    + 38.6</p>
<p>Short-term debt</p>
<p>    Belgian francs	 2,098.8   + 52.5	    +308.5</p>
<p>    foreign currencies	90.3   +  4.0	    + 14.9</p>
<p>Net debt		     9,889.8   + 47.6	    +361.2</p>
<p>Net borrowing requirement	    + 34.7	    +294.5</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
